+# Regime-gate backtest report (2026-08-16)
+
+Question: keep ADX-10 trade frequency (~4-6/day) but sit out RANGES specifically, using the
+service's live regime classifier (`service/app/regime.py`) as the entry gate.
+
+## Method
+
