+| 0.5–1 ATR | 301 | 32.6 | −1366.40 | **−4.54** | +3105.64 | −4472.04 |
+| 1–2 ATR | 131 | 38.2 | +297.58 | +2.27 | +1848.96 | −1551.38 |
